{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36908","headline":"江南寄所知周仆射 · 罗隐","name":"江南寄所知周仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾陪公子醉西园，岘首碑前事嬾言。\n世乱共嗟王粲老，时危俱受信陵恩。\n潮怜把醆吟江徼，雨忆凭阑望海门。\n飞盖寂寥清宴罢，不知簪履更谁存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}